{"id": "10th-u5-q012", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "mozhipeyarppuk_kalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_gitanjali_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாகூர் ஆங்கிலத்தில் கீதாஞ்சலியை மொழிபெயர்த்தபோது, அதற்கான முன்னுரையை (Introduction) எழுதி உலக இலக்கிய அரங்கில் அந்நூலை அறிமுகப்படுத்திய புகழ்பெற்ற ஆங்கிலக் கவிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வில்லியம் வேர்ட்ஸ்வர்த்", "B": "ஜான் கீட்ஸ்", "C": "டி. எஸ். எலியட்", "D": "டபிள்யூ. பி. யேட்ஸ் (W. B. Yeats)"}, "explanation": "தாகூரின் ஆங்கிலக் கீதாஞ்சலிக்கு உலகப் புகழ்பெற்ற ஐரிஷ்/ஆங்கிலக் கவிஞர் டபிள்யூ. பி. யேட்ஸ் (W. B. Yeats) உணர்ச்சிகரமான முன்னுரை எழுதினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which renowned poet wrote the celebrated introduction to Rabindranath Tagore's English translation of Gitanjali?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "William Wordsworth", "B": "John Keats", "C": "T. S. Eliot", "D": "W. B. Yeats"}, "explanation": "W. B. Yeats wrote the introductory praise for Tagore's Song Offerings."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 99,