{"id": "10th-u5-q017", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "mozhipeyarppuk_kalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tele_compound_words", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆங்கிலத்தில் \"Tele\" என்ற முன்னொட்டுடன் வரும் சொற்களைத் தமிழில் மொழிபெயர்க்கும்போது வழக்கமாகக் கையாளப்படும் தமிழ்ச் சொல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொலை (எ.கா: தொலைக்காட்சி, தொலைபேசி)", "B": "அண்மை", "C": "வான்", "D": "மின்"}, "explanation": "ஆங்கிலத்தின் \"Tele\" (தூரம்/தொலைவு) என்ற முன்னொட்டுத் தமிழாக்கத்தில் \"தொலை\" (Television = தொலைக்காட்சி, Telephone = தொலைபேசி, Telescope = தொலைநோக்கி) எனக் கையாளப்படுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Tamil scientific neologisms, what root word is systematically used to translate the Greek/English prefix \"Tele-\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tholai (e.g., Tholaikkaatchi, Tholaipesi)", "B": "Anmai", "C": "Vaan", "D": "Min"}, "explanation": "Tele is rendered as \"Tholai\" in standard Tamil technical terminology."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 101, "chapter": null, "section": nul