{"id": "10th-u5-q073", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "neethi_venba", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ashtavadhanam_sathavadhanam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எட்டுச் செயல்களை ஒரே நேரத்தில் நினைவில் கொண்டு செய்யும் ஆற்றல் \"அட்டாவதானம்\" எனப்படுவது போல, 100 செயல்களை நினைவில் கொண்டு செய்யும் ஆற்றல் எவ்வாறு அழைக்கப்படுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சதாவதானம்", "B": "தசாவதானம்", "C": "சகஸ்ராவதானம்", "D": "ஏகாவதானம்"}, "explanation": "அட்டம் என்றால் 8 (அட்டாவதானம்); தசம் என்றால் 10 (தசாவதானம்); சதம் என்றால் 100 (சதாவதானம்); சகஸ்ரம் என்றால் 1000 (சகஸ்ராவதானம்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Just as attending to 8 tasks simultaneously is Ashtavadhanam, attending to 100 tasks is termed what?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sathavadhanam", "B": "Dhasavadhanam", "C": "Sahasravadhanam", "D": "Ekavadhanam"}, "explanation": "Sathavadhanam denotes performing 100 memory-intensive intellectual feats at once."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 104, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil,