{"id": "10th-u5-q113", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "puthiya_nambikkai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "author_real_name", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "10-ஆம் வகுப்பு இயல் 5 விரிவானப் பகுதியான \"புதிய நம்பிக்கை\" கதையை எழுதிய கமலாலயனின் இயற்பெயர் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வே. குணசேகரன்", "B": "கி. ராஜநாராயணன்", "C": "சா. கந்தசாமி", "D": "தி. ஜானகிராமன்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: கமலாலயன் என்னும் புனைபெயரில் எழுதி வரும் எழுத்தாளரின் இயற்பெயர் வே. குணசேகரன் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the real name of author Kamalalayan who penned the inspiring supplementary reading \"Puthiya Nambikkai\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Ve. Gunasekaran", "B": "Ki. Rajanarayanan", "C": "Sa. Kandasamy", "D": "Thi. Janakiraman"}, "explanation": "Kamalalayan is the pen name of writer Ve. Gunasekaran."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 114, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 5, Page 114", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["புதிய நம்பிக்கை", "கமலாலயன்", "வே. குணசேகரன்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u5-q114", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "puthiya_nambikkai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "central_character", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"புதிய நம்பிக்கை\" துணைப்பாடக் கதையின் கதாநாயகியாக விளங்கும் கறுப்பினப் பெண் கல்வியாளர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஹெலன் கெல்லர்", "B": "மேரி மெக்லியோட் பெத்யூன் (Mary McLeod Bethune)", "C": "ரோசா பார்க்ஸ்", "D": "மலாலா யூசுப்சாய்"}, "explanation": "அமெரிக்காவில் பருத்தி காட்டில் உழைத்து, பல்வேறு தடைகளை வென்று கல்வியாளராக உயர்ந்த மேரி மெக்லியோட் பெத்யூன் அவர்களின் வாழ்க்கையே \"புதிய நம்பிக்கை\" கதையாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who is the heroic protagonist of \"Puthiya Nambikkai\", depicting the true journey of an African-American educator?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Helen Keller", "B": "Mary McLeod Bethune", "C": "Rosa Parks", "D": "Malala Yousafzai"}, "explanation": "The story portrays the early struggle and triumphs of Mary McLeod Bethune."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 110, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 5, Page 110", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["புதிய நம்பிக்கை", "மேரி மெக்லியோட் பெத்யூன்", "கதாநாயகி"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u5-q115", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "puthiya_nambikkai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "insult_turning_point", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிறுமி மேரியின் மனதில் கல்வி கற்பதற்கான பெரும் தீயை மூட்டிய அவமதிப்புச் சொல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"உனக்கு உணவு கிடையாது\"", "B": "\"நீ வேலை செய்ய லாயக்கற்றவள்\"", "C": "\"உனக்குப் படிக்கத் தெரியாது; புத்தகத்தைத் தொடாதே!\"", "D": "\"நீ எங்கள் ஊருக்குள் வராதே\""}, "explanation": "வெள்ளைக்காரப் பெண்ணின் அறையில் இருந்த வண்ணப் புத்தகத்தைத் தொட்ட மேரியிடம், \"உனக்குப் படிக்கத் தெரியாது, தொடாதே!\" என்ற அவமதிப்புச் சொற்களே அவள் நெஞ்சில் கல்வி வெறியை உண்டாக்கின."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which humiliating reprimand served as the fateful turning point igniting Mary's unstoppable thirst for literacy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "\"You get no food\"", "B": "\"You are unfit for farm labor\"", "C": "\"You do not know how to read; do not touch that book!\"", "D": "\"Never enter our town\""}, "explanation": "The stinging remark \"You don't know how to read\" galvanized her determination to master literacy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 111, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 5, Page 111", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["புதிய நம்பிக்கை", "உனக்குப் படிக்கத் தெரியாது", "திருப்பம்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u5-q116", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "puthiya_nambikkai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "teacher_wilson", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மேரி மெக்லியோட் பெத்யூன் வசித்த பகுதிக்கு வந்து கருப்பினக் குழந்தைகளுக்கான பள்ளியைத் தொடங்கி மேரியைப் படிக்க வைத்த ஆசிரியை யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மிஸ் ஆலிஸ்", "B": "மிஸ் மேரி", "C": "மிஸ் கேத்தரின்", "D": "மிஸ் வில்சன் (Miss Wilson)"}, "explanation": "மிஸ் வில்சன் என்னும் வெள்ளையின ஆசிரியை கறுப்பினக் குழந்தைகளுக்குக் கல்வி புகட்டப் பள்ளி தொடங்கியபோது, மேரி அப்பள்ளியின் முதல் மாணவியாக இணைந்தாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which compassionate missionary teacher opened a school for Black children and initiated Mary's formal schooling?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Miss Alice", "B": "Miss Mary", "C": "Miss Catherine", "D": "Miss Wilson"}, "explanation": "Miss Wilson established the rural school that admitted young Mary."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 112, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 5, Page 112"