{"id": "10th-u5-q139", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "vina_vagaigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nannool_vina_noorpa", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"அறிவு அறியாமை ஐயுறல் கொளல் கொடை ஏவல் தரும் வினா ஆறும் இழுக்கார்\" - என்று வினா வகைகளைக் கூறும் தமிழ் இலக்கண நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொல்காப்பியம்", "B": "அகத்தியம்", "C": "நன்னூல் (பவணந்தி முனிவர்)", "D": "வீரசோழியம்"}, "explanation": "வினா ஆறு வகைப்படும் என்பதை நன்னூலார் (நூற்பா 385): \"அறிவு அறியாமை ஐயுறல் கொளல் கொடை ஏவல் தரும் வினா ஆறும் இழுக்கார்\" என்று தொகுத்துக் கூறியுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which classical grammatical authority defines the 6 types of Vina with the sutra \"Arivu ariyaamai aiyural kolal kodai eeval...\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tholkappiyam", "B": "Agathiyam", "C": "Nannool (Bhavananthi Munivar)", "D": "Veerasozhiyam"}, "explanation": "Nannool classifies the 6 types of questions in this memorable sutra."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 115, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 5, Page 115", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["இலக்கணம்", "நன்னூல் நூற்பா", "வினா வகை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u5-q140", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "vidai_vagaigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nannool_vidai_noorpa", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"சுட்டு மறை நேர் ஏவல் வினாதல் உற்றது உரைத்தல் உறுவது கூறல் இனமொழி எனும் எண் இறையினுள்...\" - என்ற நன்னூல் நூற்பா விளக்குவது எதனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருள்கோள் எட்டு வகை", "B": "வேற்றுமை எட்டு வகை", "C": "திணை வகைகள்", "D": "விடை எட்டு வகை (இறை = விடை)"}, "explanation": "நன்னூலில் விடையை \"இறை\" என்றும் கூறுவர். எட்டு வகையான விடைகளை \"எண் இறையினுள்\" என நன்னூல் தெளிவாக விளக்குகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which grammatical classification is codified by the Nannool sutra \"Suttu marai naer eeval vinaathal uttrathu uraithal uruvathu kooral inamozhi...\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Eight types of Porulkol", "B": "Eight types of Vetrumai cases", "C": "Thinai classifications", "D": "Eight types of Vidai (Answers, traditionally termed \"Irai\")"}, "explanation": "Nannool outlines the 8 response types (Irai / Vidai) in this rule."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_yea